weapon_name = "Skald's Lament"
description = "A long spear with a verse cut spiraling down the haft — a death-song for whoever's at the wrong end. The skalds of Hollowmere keep one for themselves. The verse is meant to be sung aloud during the kill, but no one's checking. Long reach, steady tempo."
